---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";

const title = "PelliScope Europe | Refund policy";
const description = "Payment and refund status for the PelliScope European controlled pilot.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical="https://pelliscope.eu/refunds.html">
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="legal-main">
    <section class="legal-hero section-shell">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span>European operation · Last updated 26 July 2026</p>
      <h1>Payment and<br /><em>refund status.</em></h1>
      <p>
        PelliScope does not currently offer routine paid patient consultations in any EU country. This page explains
        what that means now and what must be disclosed before a future payment.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="legal-layout section-shell">
      <aside class="legal-summary">
        <strong>Today</strong>
        <p>No public EU consultation price. No routine paid consultation checkout. Pilot and community registration do not create a patient charge.</p>
      </aside>
      <article class="legal-copy">
        <section>
          <h2>1. No current public paid consultation</h2>
          <p>
            Exploring the website, applying to the professional community or registering interest in a pilot does not
            create a paid patient consultation. Because no routine EU paid consultation is currently offered, there is
            no standard EU consultation refund schedule in operation.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2>2. Before any future payment</h2>
          <p>
            If a country service launches, the checkout must show the total patient price, what is being purchased,
            the participating clinician or provider, expected response range, cancellation rules and refund conditions
            before payment is confirmed. Applicable mandatory consumer and healthcare rights will remain in force.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2>3. Free pilot and community activity</h2>
          <p>
            A free pilot interaction or voluntary open-community contribution has no purchase price and therefore no
            payment to refund. It also does not guarantee future clinical availability or admission to a professional
            programme.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2>4. Unexpected or mistaken charge</h2>
          <p>
            If you believe you have been charged in connection with PelliScope Europe, do not submit payment details
            by email. Write to <a href="mailto:contact@hawkfranklin.in">contact@hawkfranklin.in</a> with the payment
            date, amount and transaction reference so the charge can be investigated securely.
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
